  "pages": [
    {
      "page": 308,
      "rows": 27,
      "periodLocations": [
        {
          "block": 1,
          "blockLine": 2,
          "character": 27,
          "pageMdLine": 48,
          "text": "生电流的方向与磁铁靠近线圈或远离线圈有关（图280）。",
          "expected": "U+002E",
          "actual": "U+3002"
        },
        {
          "block": 2,
          "blockLine": 1,
          "character": 15,
          "pageMdLine": 51,
          "text": "感生电流与磁铁要发生相互作用。有电流通过的线圈和",
          "expected": "U+002E",
          "actual": "U+3002"
        },
        {
          "block": 2,
          "blockLine": 2,
          "character": 21,
          "pageMdLine": 52,
          "text": "具有两个磁极（北极和南极）的磁铁是一样的。感生电流的方",
          "expected": "U+002E",
          "actual": "U+3002"
        },
        {
          "block": 2,
          "blockLine": 4,
          "character": 15,
          "pageMdLine": 54,
          "text": "端是南极（磁力线从南极进去）。根据能量守恒定律，可以说",
          "expected": "U+002E",
          "actual": "U+3002"
        },
        {
          "block": 2,
          "blockLine": 6,
          "character": 2,
          "pageMdLine": 56,
          "text": "铁。",
          "expected": "U+002E",
          "actual": "U+3002"
        },
        {
          "block": 3,
          "blockLine": 2,
          "character": 4,
          "pageMdLine": 60,
          "text": "斥磁铁。这样为了使磁铁和线圈靠近，就必须做正功。此时，",
          "expected": "U+002E",
          "actual": "U+3002"
        },
        {
          "block": 3,
          "blockLine": 2,
          "character": 24,
          "pageMdLine": 60,
          "text": "斥磁铁。这样为了使磁铁和线圈靠近，就必须做正功。此时，",
          "expected": "U+002E",
          "actual": "U+3002"
        },
        {
          "block": 3,
          "blockLine": 3,
          "character": 24,
          "pageMdLine": 61,
          "text": "线圈对着运动磁铁的一端应当变成与磁铁相同的磁极。同性",
          "expected": "U+002E",
          "actual": "U+3002"
        },
        {
          "block": 3,
          "blockLine": 4,
          "character": 5,
          "pageMdLine": 62,
          "text": "磁极排斥。",
          "expected": "U+002E",
          "actual": "U+3002"
        },
        {
          "block": 4,
          "blockLine": 1,
          "character": 11,
          "pageMdLine": 65,
          "text": "设想与上述相反的情况。你们把磁铁稍稍地向线圈移动",
          "expected": "U+002E",
          "actual": "U+3002"
        },
        {
          "block": 4,
          "blockLine": 2,
          "character": 18,
          "pageMdLine": 66,
          "text": "一点，则磁铁就自动地进入线圈的内部。这就破坏了能量守",
          "expected": "U+002E",
          "actual": "U+3002"
        },
        {
          "block": 4,
          "blockLine": 3,
          "character": 4,
          "pageMdLine": 67,
          "text": "恒定律。因为磁铁的动能增加了，同时还产生了电流，这就必",
          "expected": "U+002E",
          "actual": "U+3002"
        },
        {
          "block": 4,
          "blockLine": 5,
          "character": 4,
          "pageMdLine": 69,
          "text": "的能量。",
          "expected": "U+002E",
          "actual": "U+3002"
        },
        {
          "block": 5,
          "blockLine": 2,
          "character": 5,
          "pageMdLine": 73,
          "text": "出现引力。",
          "expected": "U+002E",
          "actual": "U+3002"
        },
        {
          "block": 6,
          "blockLine": 3,
          "character": 3,
          "pageMdLine": 78,
          "text": "确性。在能够绕竖直轴自由",
          "expected": "U+002E",
          "actual": "U+3002"
        },
        {
          "block": 6,
          "blockLine": 6,
          "character": 3,
          "pageMdLine": 81,
          "text": "口的。如果把磁铁移近没有切口的环，则在环中产生感生电",
          "expected": "U+002E",
          "actual": "U+3002"
        }
      ],
